'''Avorius''' is an [[NPC]] that lives in {{zone|Scarleton}}.

== Quest ==
Giving {{Item|Cup of Blood|amount=1}} to '''Avorius''' while a member of the Mage [[Faction]] rewards the player with {{Reputation|mage|+5}}. This can be done once every {{Green|3}} days.

